## 2. Error Swallowing Audit & Remediation Matrix

Worker 02 identified 7 critical files exhibiting dangerous error-swallowing antipatterns. Each pattern violates repository coding guidelines, masks real system faults, and must be refactored to use affirmative booleans (`isSuccess`, `hasError`) and structured error envelopes.

| File Path | Legacy Anti-Pattern | Root Risk | Remediation Target |
|:---|:---|:---|:---|
| `src/lib/observability/cliSessions.functions.ts` | Catches 404, 403, `E_BE_UNAVAILABLE`, `E_BE_BAD_RESPONSE` and returns fake `{ items: [], total: 0 }`. | Operators assume no CLI sessions exist when the backend is crashed or unreachable. | Rethrow structured `EnvelopeError` or return typed `Result<CliSessionsPage, AppError>`; never fabricate empty state. |
| `src/lib/observability/cliSession.functions.ts` | Catches transport errors and synthesizes dummy session summary with `Source: "unknown"`, `Records: []`, `SizeBytes: 0`. | UI renders a misleading "phantom" empty session page without alerting the user that the run ID was not found. | Throw `EnvelopeError` with HTTP status and code so the route boundary renders a 404/503 alert state. |
| `src/lib/observability/sessions.functions.ts` | Catches `err.isMissingOrUnavailable` and returns empty page with `nextCursor: null`. | Masks database tier lag or connection failures in Root-DB. | Propagate error to boundary; return `ResultEnvelope<SessionsPage>` containing the actionable diagnostic error code. |
| `src/lib/observability/savedViews.ts` | `safeRead()` returns `[]` on parse error; `safeWrite()` returns `false` on storage quota error; uses `{ ok: false }`. | Corrupt view data is silently lost; users do not know their filters failed to persist; `ok` violates boolean standards. | Replace `{ ok }` with `{ isSuccess, hasError }`; log structured breadcrumb; throw `StorageQuotaError` on write failures. |
| `src/lib/stores/run-store.ts` | `facadeReadJson` & `facadeReadJsonWithMigration` return `null` on JSON parse fault; `facadeWriteJson` swallows async rejection. | Corrupt inspection run configurations reset to blank; writes fail silently during active production runs. | Capture error in `useErrorStore.captureException`; raise warning toast to operator; log to `ClientLogger`. |
| `src/lib/data-source/store.ts` | `readInitial()`, `readInitialBaseUrl()`, `readInitialPersistRules()` catch all storage errors and return defaults. | Misconfigured base URLs silently default to mock/seed mode without user notice. | Emit structured `ClientLogger.warn` breadcrumbs and record fallback transitions in error telemetry. |
| `src/components/hmi/CameraPreview.tsx` | `videoRef.current.play().catch(() => undefined)` and `.catch(() => setStatus("denied"))` discard native error objects. | Camera driver lockouts, DMA permission faults, and USB bus drops cannot be debugged. | Capture exact `DOMException` (e.g. `NotAllowedError`, `NotFoundError`, `AbortError`); pipe to `ClientLogger.error`. |

